Update Update(edited_message=Message(channel_chat_created=False, chat=Chat(id=-1002055858151, title='BOMBO', type=<ChatType.SUPERGROUP>), date=datetime.datetime(2024, 9, 15, 18, 49, 23, tzinfo=<UTC>), delete_chat_photo=False, edit_date=datetime.datetime(2024, 9, 15, 18, 50, 16, tzinfo=<UTC>), from_user=User(first_name='AdriM', id=6840795810, is_bot=False, is_premium=True, username='adrim_6'), group_chat_created=False, message_id=921850, message_thread_id=921841, reply_to_message=Message(channel_chat_created=False, chat=Chat(id=-1002055858151, title='BOMBO', type=<ChatType.SUPERGROUP>), date=datetime.datetime(2024, 9, 15, 18, 45, 20, tzinfo=<UTC>), delete_chat_photo=False, edit_date=datetime.datetime(2024, 9, 15, 18, 45, 55, tzinfo=<UTC>), from_user=User(first_name='Ksif0n', id=7033654003, is_bot=False, is_premium=True, language_code='fi', username='Ksif0nuska'), group_chat_created=False, message_id=921841, supergroup_chat_created=False, text='Hey bombo ❤️\n\nWhat a rally, so many of us have been here since BCLAT. Oh those days. Remember that fatta eating mc? Haha. \n\nI loved those. \n\nBoys (devs i mean, for me they are boys, my boys) have been here since march, every day. They have been giving it all. \n\nSpratty and Pops slept in van for what, two or three weeks to drive through EU? Haha. \n\nRemember when boys had their last day at their dayjob? Or fatta and birdie tats? All those crazy nights.. 😂\n\n\nYou know where im going with this right? \n\nJust suggesting to load up with this dip. \n\n❤️💋'), sender_boost_count=7, supergroup_chat_created=False, text="They are committed!!!\n\nThey can't fail! They won't allow it!\n\nThey will fight for success till they make us all millionaires!\n\nBombo is their life!\n\nI fully support them, we are so lucky to have devs like them!\n\nLOCK IN!"), update_id=21541931) caused an error: 
 'NoneType' object has no attribute 'text'
